                <p class=3D"msg-content scaleable">The next-generation Pavo=
 Pico II is the ultimate compact cinewhoop, completely redesigned for the D=
JI O4 system. It features a new rigid frame with guided mounting for easy a=
ssembly, the innovative O4 Bracket II with 4 shock absorbers to eliminate j=
ello, and a new carbon plate that fits the O4, O4 Wide and O4 Pro air units=
. Powered by upgraded LAVA 1102 motors for 10% more power and efficiency, a=
ll in a lightweight design, it delivers stunning, smooth 4K footage whereve=
r you fly. Maximum Performance, Minimal Size.</p>
<p class=3D"msg-content scaleable"><img src=3D"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/fi=
les/1/1778/6615/files/Pavo_Pico_II_Brushless_Whoop_Quadcopter_maximum_perfo=
rmance.jpg?v=3D1785828613" alt=3D"Pavo Pico II Brushless Whoop Quadcopter m=
aximum performance"></p>
<h2 class=3D"msg-content scaleable">Bullet Points</h2>
<ul>
<li><span>O4 Air Unit Bracket II: The integrated bracket with 4 shock-absor=
bing balls eliminate jello for butter-smooth video.</span></li>
<li>Next-Gen Frame: The supported structure with guided mouting points and =
4-screw design make assembly quick and incredibly rigid.</li>
<li>O4, O4 Wide &amp; O4 Pro Compatibility: A redesigned carbon plate seaml=
essly integrates O4, O4 Wide and O4 Pro for stunning HD footage and build v=
ersatility.</li>
<li>New Propulsion: The upgraded LAVA 1102 motors and GF 45mm props deliver=
 a remarkable 10% power increase for explosive thrust, while also enabling =
extended flight times.</li>
<li>Small and Lightweight: At a mere 53.7g/59.0g with an 80mm wheelbase, th=
is pocket-sized powerhouse combines an ultra-lightweight design with the ra=
w thrust.</li>
<li>Advanced Flight Controller: F4 20A AIO FC with dual BECs, supporting 9V=
 2A for HD VTX and 5V 3A for external devices.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Specifications</h2>
<ul>
<li><span>Items: Pavo Pico II Brushless Whoop Quadcopter</span></li>
<li><span>Color: Black</span></li>
<li><span>Wheelbase: 80mm</span></li>
<li>Frame:&nbsp;<a href=3D"https://betafpv.com/products/pavo-pico-ii-brushl=
ess-whoop-frame" rel=3D"noopener" target=3D"_blank">Pavo Pico II Brushless =
Whoop Frame</a><span></span>
</li>
<li>FC: <a href=3D"https://betafpv.com/products/f4-2-3s-20a-aio-fc-v1">F4 2=
-3S 20A AIO FC</a>
</li>
<li>Motor:&nbsp;<a rel=3D"noopener" href=3D"https://betafpv.com/products/la=
va-series-1102-brushless-motors">LAVA 1102 | 14000KV</a>
</li>
<li>Props: <a href=3D"https://betafpv.com/products/gemfan-45mm-2-blade-3-bl=
ade-propellers-1-5mm-shaft-4pcs" rel=3D"noopener" target=3D"_blank">GF 45mm=
 3B Prop</a>
</li>
<li>Battery Connector: XT30</li>
<li>Battery Slot: 16*12.7mm</li>
<li>Flight Time: 6:10 (O4 Wide version with LAVA 2S 550mAh batteries), 6:30=
 (O4 version with LAVA 2S 550mAh batteries)</li>
<li>Weight: 59.0g (O4 Wide version), 53.7g (O4 version), 39.1g (PNP version=
)</li>
<li>RX Version: Serial ELRS, DJI SBUS</li>
</ul>
<h2>Cinematic Clarity in the Palm of Your Hand</h2>
<p>Under 60g with an 80mm wheelbase, the Pavo Pico II delivers breathtaking=
 HD performance in a compact design. Paired with the DJI O4 and O4 Wide Air=
 Unit=E2=80=94offering a remarkable 159=C2=B0 ultra-wide FOV=E2=80=94it cap=
tures 4K/60fps video with ultra-low 20ms latency and incredible 10km transm=
ission range. From tight indoor spaces to wide-open skies, experience cinem=
atic quality wherever you fly.</p>
<p><img alt=3D"DJI O4 vs O4 Wide FOV" src=3D"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/file=
s/1/1778/6615/files/DJI_O4_vs_O4_Wide_FOV.jpg?v=3D1783665027"></p>
<h2>O4 Bracket II: Eliminate the Jello</h2>
<p><span>Building on our proven design, the next-generation O4 Bracket II i=
s engineered for one goal: perfect jello-free video. The first-generation b=
racket untilizes separate shock-absorbing components for the O4 camera, whi=
ch is lightweight but complex to assemble and occasionally prone to jello f=
rom imperfect installation. In contrast, the O4 Bracket II introduces a ful=
ly integrated vibration-damping system. The camera is securely mounted with=
 4 screws for simplicity and rigidity, while 4 soft-mounted shock-absorbing=
 balls replace rigid connections to isolate vibrations effortlessly. This r=
efined approach eliminates complexity while delivering superior damping per=
formance and long-term stability=E2=80=94so you can focus on capturing flaw=
less video.</span></p>
<p><img alt=3D"O4 Bracket II vs O4 Bracket" src=3D"https://cdn.shopify.com/=
s/files/1/1778/6615/files/O4_Bracket_II_vs_O4_Bracket.jpg?v=3D1758277671"><=
/p>
<p><em>Note: For pilots having the Pavo Pico II who wish to use the <a href=
=3D"https://betafpv.com/products/canopy-ii-for-o4-air-unit">Canopy II for O=
4 Air Unit</a>, the <a href=3D"https://betafpv.com/products/canopy-ii-for-o=
4-air-unit?variant=3D44223863849094">Pavo Pico II Top Plate</a> is the solu=
tion.</em></p>
<h2>Pavo Pico II Frame<br>
</h2>
<p>The Pavo Pico II frame revolutionizes assembly simplicity. Featuring emb=
edded nuts, it requires just four screws for a secure connection that withs=
tands crashes and ensures hassle-free building. Its advanced injection-mold=
ing technology combines a supported structure and three guided mounting poi=
nts, guaranteeing perfect carbon plate alignment every time while eliminati=
ng flex for an incredibly rigid platform. This streamlined approach makes b=
uilding a durable and high-performance setup easier than ever.</p>
<p><img src=3D"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1778/6615/files/Pavo_Pico_=
II_Frame_features.jpg?v=3D1758512653" alt=3D"Pavo Pico II Brushless Whoop F=
rame features"></p>
<p>The newly designed carbon plate seamlessly integrates the DJI O4, O4 Wid=
e and O4 Pro, future-proofing your build and empowering you to capture stun=
ning HD footage without compromise. With pre-tuned PID parameters optimized=
 for O4 systems, achieving peak performance is effortless=E2=80=94simply se=
lect your configuration via the OSD and fly with confidence.</p>
<p><img src=3D"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1778/6615/files/Pavo_Pico_=
II_Brushless_Whoop_Quadcopter_O4_compatibility.jpg?v=3D1785828543" alt=3D"P=
avo Pico II Brushless Whoop Quadcopter O4 compatibility"></p>
<p>For pilots seeking even greater versatility, the frame supports extensiv=
e DIY customization. Attach battery straps or 3D-printed components to acco=
mmodate various battery sizes, tailoring your setup to match specific fligh=
t preferences and performance requirements.</p>
<p><img src=3D"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/1778/6615/files/ca7d6d1=
690899c1a7e3707ee38ad3fe4_605b0530-9150-4522-9d21-a6b3685878f0_1024x1024.jp=
g?v=3D1692181927" alt=3D"Pavo Pico Brushless Whoop Quadcopter"></p>
<h2><span>Flight Controller</span></h2>
<p>The Pavo Pico II features an&nbsp;<a href=3D"https://betafpv.com/product=
s/f4-2-3s-20a-aio-fc-v1">F4 2-3S 20A AIO Flight Controller</a> specifically=
 designed for HD VTX. Equipped with a dual BEC solution, it provides stable=
 power outputs of 9V 2A for the DJI O4 system and 5V 3A for external device=
s. The 20A ESC ensures agile and dynamic flight performance, while dedicate=
d HD VTX 6-Pin connectors and a conveniently positioned USB ports simplify =
installation and maintenance. This FC brings exceptional reliability and pr=
ofessional-grade functionality for Pavo Pico II.</p>
<p><img src=3D"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1778/6615/files/F4_2-3S_20=
A_AIO_FC_V1_-_to_be_the_best_aio_fc_for_203s_hd_whoop.jpg?v=3D1785751668" a=
lt=3D"F4 2-3S 20A AIO FC V1 - to be the best aio fc for 203s hd whoop"></p>
<p><em>Note: From August 2026, the F4 2=E2=80=913S 20A FC fitted in our who=
ops will be available with either an STM32F405 or AT32F435 MCU. Both versio=
ns deliver identical flight performance and will be shipped at random, depe=
nding on stock availability.</em></p>
<h2><span>Powerful Propulsion System</span></h2>
<p>Experience a leap in performance with the all-new LAVA 1102 14000KV moto=
rs and custom-engineered Gemfan 45mm 3 blade props. This optimized combinat=
ion delivers a massive 10% increase in propulsion for explosive acceleratio=
n, while also achieving remarkable efficiency for extended flight times up =
to 6:30 minutes.</p>
<p><img src=3D"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1778/6615/files/Pavo_Pico_=
II_Brushless_Whoop_quadcopter_-_10_more_power.jpg?v=3D1758091057" alt=3D"Pa=
vo Pico II Brushless Whoop quadcopter - 10% more power"></p>
